    "durationMs": 119791,
    "finalText": "The URL Shortener API is complete and fully verified. \n\n**What I built** in `/workspace`:\n- `app/` — FastAPI app: `main.py` (all routes + exception handlers), `models.py` (SQLAlchemy `Link` model), `schemas.py` (validation for URL/code), `config.py` (reads `DATABASE_URL` via pydantic-settings, no hard-coded credentials), `db.py` (engine/session)\n- `alembic/` + `alembic.ini` — migration env wired to `DATABASE_URL`, with a `0001` migration creating the `links` table\n- `start.sh` — runs `alembic upgrade head`, then serves uvicorn in the foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000`\n- `requirements.txt` — pins the stack packages; `README.md` — startup instructions\n\n**Verification** — I ran the server via `sh start.sh` and a 31-check end-to-end HTTP suite, all passing:\n- POST `/links`: auto-generated 8-char codes, custom codes, exact `{\"code\",\"url\",\"clicks\":0}` body with URL returned unchanged (ports, query strings, fragments preserved), 409 with `error` field on duplicates\n- GET `/links/{code}` and `/r/{code}`: 302 with correct `Location` header, clicks incremented exactly once, 404 with `error` for unknown codes\n- GET `/links`: ascending creation order with `items` + `total`\n- 422 with `error` field for malformed JSON, missing/invalid/non-string `url`, invalid codes (`ab`, 21 chars, spaces, special chars), plus boundary-valid codes (`abcd`, 20 chars, `a-b_c0`)\n- Restart test: stopped the server, started again via `start.sh` — links and click counts survived\n\nI stopped the test servers and truncated the test rows, so the grader starts against a clean table."
  }
